{"articleNo":"346759","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=346759&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2022 GKS Admission Call for Graduate School Studying at KIT, Korea","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.02.17","hit":"30229","attachments":[{"name":"2. 2022 GKS-G 선발 업무 지침.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=346759&attachNo=109103"},{"name":"3. 2022 GKS-G Application Guidelines (Korean).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=346759&attachNo=109104"},{"name":"4. 2022 GKS-G Application Guidelines (English).doc","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=346759&attachNo=109105"},{"name":"5. 2022 GKS-G Application Forms.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=346759&attachNo=109106"},{"name":"6. 2022 GKS-G Application FAQ.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=346759&attachNo=109107"},{"name":"★ Available Field of Study_KIT.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=346759&attachNo=109108"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">2022&nbsp;</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#0900FF\">GKS\nAdmission Call</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:black\">&nbsp;for Graduate School Studying at KIT, Korea</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">We are\npleased to inform you of 2022&nbsp;GKS (Global Korea Scholarship) Guideline for\nMaster’s and Doctoral candidates here in Korea.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">As the\none and only national engineering specialized university in Korea, we will be\nable to nominate candidates up to 35. This might be a great opportunity for you\nto be able to study in Korea with a full government scholarship.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">Please\nsee attached for further information and if there are any candidates interested\nin this program, please send me&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red\">one original application document\npackage no later than March 31<sup>st</sup>, (Thursday), 2022</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">. Your\noriginal application documents must be delivered to my office by the deadline.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">1. Applicants' GPA must\nbe more than 2.64 on a 4.0 scale, 2.80 on a 4.3 scale, 2.91 on a 4.5 scale,\n3.23 on a 5.0 scale, or score percentile of 80% from your university.</span> <span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">(Exception: A former or\ncurrent KGSP scholar must hold the grade of 90% or above)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">And if the transcript does\nnot contain information about overall CGPA or if it is difficult to convert,\nplease submit additional official explanation data of your university. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">2.&nbsp;Applicants who\nsubmit applications to more than two designated institutions will be\ndisqualified.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">3.&nbsp;Scholarship\nduration: Master's(1 yr. of Korean Language + 2 yrs. of Master'), Doctoral(1\nyr. of Korean Language + 3 yrs. of Doctoral)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;background:white;word-break:\nbreak-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">*In\nthe case that scholar could not be able to complete one’s degree within\nscholarship duration, scholar should take care of one’s living expenses by\noneself.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;background:white;word-break:\nbreak-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">4.&nbsp;Applicants\nmust be under 40 years of age as of Sep.1<sup>st</sup>, 2022(born after Sep. 1,\n1982).<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;background:white;word-break:\nbreak-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">5. Applicants’\ndocuments MUST apostilled or <span style=\"letter-spacing:-.25pt\">consular-confirmed.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">All required documents\nmust be written by computer typing and send us one original document by post\nonly (no e-mail application will be accepted). We don’t have online application\nfor this GKS admission.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">For further\ninformation, please see attached, visit website (<a href=\"http://eng.kumoh.ac.kr/\"><span style=\"color:windowtext\">http://eng.kumoh.ac.kr</span></a>)\nor contact GKS coordinator, Minkyeong Kwon.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;background:white;word-break:\nbreak-all\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:red\">Submission Deadline:&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:\nyellow;mso-highlight:yellow\">March 31<sup>st</sup>, (Thursday), 2022</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red\">Submission\naddress:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">61\nDaehak-ro, Gumi, Gyeongbuk, Korea,</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Kumoh\nNational Institute of Technology</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">International\nPrograms and Language Education Center</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;background:white;word-break:\nbreak-all\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:black\">International Education Building, 1<sup>st</sup> floor, E103\n(Postal Code 39177)</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red\">Contact\nPerson:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Minkyeong\nKwon</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">[Office]\n+82-54-478-7223</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-all\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">[Email] <a href=\"mailto:mkkwon@kumoh.ac.kr\">mkkwon@kumoh.ac.kr</a> , <a href=\"mailto:mkkwon.kit@gmail.com\">mkkwon.kit@gmail.com</a> </span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
